# Backup set "archive": the documents the law asks to keep for ten years —
# signed contracts, invoices, receipts, tax filings. Their own set, because
# they must outlive everything else here, and everything else must be able to
# go: work keeps a few months, this keeps ten years.
#
# Nothing is ever deleted from the folder before its time; the history only
# covers mistakes. Placeholders and `?` as in work.paths. Credentials:
# BACKUP_ARCHIVE_* in .env, history: BACKUP_ARCHIVE_KEEP_*. docs/backup.md
${MEDIA_ROOT}/archive
